\[\mathbf{p}^{2}=E^{2}-|\vec{p}|^{2}=M^{2} \tag{5.3}\]

mas por conservacao de momento e energia do decaimento de um _heavy-quarkonium_ em \(e^{+}e^{-}\) temos que

\[\mathbf{p}^{2}=(\mathbf{p}_{e^{+}}+\mathbf{p}_{e^{-}})^{2}=\mathbf{ p}_{e^{+}}^{2}+\mathbf{p}_{e^{-}}^{2}+2\mathbf{p}_{e^{+}}\mathbf{p}_{e^{-}}\] \[=m_{e^{+}}^{2}+m_{e^{-}}^{2}+2(E_{e^{+}}E_{e^{-}}-\vec{p}_{e^{+}} \vec{p}_{e^{-}})\] \[=2(m_{e}^{2}+E_{e^{+}}E_{e^{-}}-\vec{p}_{e^{+}}\vec{p}_{e^{-}}) \tag{5.4}\]

